Emergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nComprehensive and Compassionate Care for Dayton Pets Every Day of the Year\nMedVet Dayton is a premier animal emergency and specialty hospital and urgent care in the Dayton area. Our highly trained team serves as an extension of your family veterinarian’s care.\nServing more than 20,000 patients a year, our team is the trusted choice for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional, compassionate care. Our team has the expertise to skillfully deal with any pet emergency and provide advanced specialty care for your pet with the goal of getting your pet home to you in the best health.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet Dayton Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nEmergency Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nOphthalmology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nOur Hospital Leaders\nAnna Bentley, DVM\nMedical Director\nCarlisa Harris\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nAmy Back\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nKhelsea Bahr\n, DVM\nSurgery\nMatthew Baron-Chapman\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nAnna  Bentley\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nTyler Chipps\n, DVM\nSurgery\nChase Constant\n, VMD, DACVR\nRadiology\nSuzanne Ellis\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJulia Fernandez\n, BVMS\nEmergency Medicine\nVictoria  Fisher\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nRobin Hopwood\n, DVM, MS, PhD, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nKryssa  Johnson\n, DVM, DACVR\nRadiology\nVanessa Kuonen Cavens\n, DVM, MS, DACVO\n®\nOphthalmology\nEmily McConnelly\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDanielle McPherson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine, Urgent Care\nE. Michael Moeller\n, DVM, MS, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nMegan Neumeier\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAmy Oberstadt\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nOlivia Price\n, DVM, MSpVM, Limited to the Practice of Surgery\nSurgery\nSydney Schiavone\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMarilize  Van der Walt\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Internal Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nAnn Will\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine, Urgent Care\nShow All Doctors (\n21\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nI’m so grateful for MedVet’s help with my sweet 5-week-old kitten, Lilo. As a first-time kitten owner, I didn’t know what to do when she experienced sudden health issues late at night. The staff were attentive, compassionate, and extremely helpful. I appreciated their thorough communication, transparency, and love for Lilo—who’s now recovering!”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
